@api = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@provider = demo-provider-one

### Read assigned patients
GET {{api}}/v1/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{provider}}

### Read encounter and clinical data
GET {{api}}/v1/visits/VISIT-001
Authorization: Bearer {{provider}}

### Save a draft (repeat safely with the same operation ID)
POST {{api}}/v1/charges
Authorization: Bearer {{provider}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operationId": "example-save-1",
  "chargeId": "example-charge-1",
  "expectedVersion": 0,
  "charge": {
    "visitId": "VISIT-001",
    "serviceCode": "99213",
    "quantity": 1,
    "dateOfService": "2026-01-15",
    "modifiers": ["25"],
    "notes": "Synthetic encounter note"
  }
}

### Queue the draft for billing
POST {{api}}/v1/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{provider}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"clientSubmissionId":"example-submit-1","chargeIds":["example-charge-1"]}

### Inspect charge outcome
GET {{api}}/v1/charges/example-charge-1
Authorization: Bearer {{provider}}

### Hospital audit
GET {{api}}/v1/admin/audit?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer demo-admin-one

### Hospital queue state
GET {{api}}/v1/admin/metrics
Authorization: Bearer demo-admin-one

### Simulate the next two billing requests failing
POST http://127.0.0.1:4001/admin/mode
Authorization: Bearer demo-billing-secret
Content-Type: application/json

{"hospitalId":"HOSP-001","mode":"outage","remaining":2}
